{"seq":1,"slug":"quantifying-information","title":"度量信息","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/quantifying-information","wordCount":1632,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"度量信息\">度量信息</h1><p>在香农之前，「信息」是工程师每天打交道、却无人能称量的东西。你能说一封电报「比较长」，却说不出它含「多少」信息；你能感觉一条新闻「很重要」，却没有单位去标定它。香农一九四八年最根本的一步，是把「信息量」变成一个可以用数字、用比特（bit）写下来的物理量。</p>\n<p>本篇专讲「如何给信息定一把尺」——即比特的定义、对数度量的来由、以及「信息 = 消除的不确定性」这一核心直觉。把这把尺推向「平均」与「极限」的部分，留给姊妹篇 <a href=\"the-concept-of-entropy\">信息熵的概念</a>；本篇只管单条消息层面的度量，避免与之重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>香农度量信息的钥匙，是把「信息量」挂到「概率」这根可计算的轴上：一条消息的信息量不取决于它的意义，而取决于它<strong>消除了多少不确定性</strong>。单条消息用自信息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 度量，单位是比特（一次等概率二选一）。选对数而非选项个数，是被一条工程要求<strong>唯一逼出</strong>的：两个独立来源的信息量必须相加，而对数恰好把概率的乘法变成信息的加法。这是整座信息论大厦的第一块砖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心直觉-信息是被消除的不确定性\">核心直觉：信息是被消除的不确定性</h2><p>香农的起点是一个看似平常、却扭转全局的认识：一条消息的信息量，不取决于它的「意义」，而取决于它<strong>消除了多少不确定性</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>「明天太阳从东边升起」——你早已确知，信息量近乎零。</li>\n<li>「明天本市下冰雹」——出人意料，信息量很大。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同一句话，越出乎意料，信息量越大；越是确定无疑，信息量越小。这把「信息」从语义的泥潭里拽了出来，挂到了「概率」这根可计算的轴上。把这一「剥离意义」上升为方法论的讨论，见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/the-power-of-abstraction/separating-information-from-meaning\">思想方法·把信息与意义分离</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"比特-一个二元选择的信息量\">比特：一个二元选择的信息量</h2><p>香农引入<strong>比特</strong>（binary digit 的缩写，据他论文致谢，这个词由同事 J. W. Tukey 提议）作为信息的基本单位。一个比特，恰好是一次「是/否」「0/1」「正面/反面」的等概率二元选择所含的信息量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;1 个等概率二元选择&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1 比特&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;从 4 个等可能选项中确定 1 个&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;2 比特 = log₂4&quot;]&#10;    E[&quot;从 8 个等可能选项中确定 1 个&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;3 比特 = log₂8&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;从 N 个等可能选项中确定 1 个&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;log₂N 比特&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"1 个等概率二元选择\"] --&gt; B[\"1 比特\"]\n    C[\"从 4 个等可能选项中确定 1 个\"] --&gt; D[\"2 比特 = log₂4\"]\n    E[\"从 8 个等可能选项中确定 1 个\"] --&gt; F[\"3 比特 = log₂8\"]\n    G[\"从 N 个等可能选项中确定 1 个\"] --&gt; H[\"log₂N 比特\"]</pre><p>为什么是「等概率二元选择」做单位？因为它是最小的、不可再分的「一次决断」。任何更复杂的选择，都可以拆成若干次这样的二元决断——从 8 个选项里定位 1 个，等价于连问三次「在上半还是下半」，故需 3 比特。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对数的必然-可加性的要求\">对数的必然：可加性的要求</h2><p>香农为什么用对数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span> 来度量，而不是直接用「选项个数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>」？因为度量必须满足一条工程上理所当然的性质：<strong>两个独立来源的信息量应当相加</strong>。</p>\n<p>设事件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，定义其自信息为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>单位：比特</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(x) = \\log_2 \\frac{1}{p(x)} = -\\log_2 p(x) \\quad (\\text{单位：比特})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位：比特</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>考察可加性：两个独立事件同时发生，概率相乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而对数把乘法变成加法——</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = -\\log_2(p_1 p_2) = -\\log_2 p_1 - \\log_2 p_2 = I_1 + I_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正是这条「独立事件信息可加」的要求，<strong>唯一地</strong>逼出了对数形式。下表用具体数字展示它如何自然吻合直觉：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>自信息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抛硬币得正面</td>\n<td>1/2</td>\n<td>1 比特</td>\n<td>一次二元选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掷骰子得 6</td>\n<td>1/6</td>\n<td>≈2.58 比特</td>\n<td>六选一，多于 2 比特</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽到红桃 A</td>\n<td>1/52</td>\n<td>≈5.70 比特</td>\n<td>五十二选一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定会发生的事</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0 比特</td>\n<td>毫无新信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几乎不可能的事</td>\n<td>→0</td>\n<td>→∞ 比特</td>\n<td>越罕见越「震撼」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意最后两行：确知之事信息为零，极罕之事信息趋于无穷——这正是「信息 = 惊讶程度」的精确化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量的威力-让一切媒介通约\">度量的威力：让一切媒介通约</h2><p>这把尺最深远的后果，是让原本不可比较的东西有了共同货币。文字、声音、图像、视频，过去各有各的「单位」，互不相干；用比特度量后，它们第一次可以放在同一根轴上比较与换算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一页纯文本约几千比特；</li>\n<li>一秒 CD 音质音频约 1.4 兆比特；</li>\n<li>这正是为什么今天我们能用「带宽」「存储」「码率」统一地谈论一切数字内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>没有这把统一的尺，就没有「把照片、电话、电视都塞进同一根光纤」的数字融合。比特之所以成为数字时代的通用语言，根子就在这次度量的发明。比特如何进一步成为数字世界的底层，见 <a href=\"../digital-foundations/foundations-of-digital-age\">数字基础·数字时代的基础</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-度量信息时常见的三种误读\">反模式：度量信息时常见的三种误读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把信息量等同于价值</strong>：一串完全随机的字符自信息最高，却毫无用处。香农度量的是「不可预测性」，不是「重要性」或「真实性」。</li>\n<li><strong>忘了概率是相对于谁的</strong>：信息量取决于接收者的先验概率。同一条消息对已知者信息为零、对不知者信息很大——信息是「关系量」，不是消息自带的绝对属性。</li>\n<li><strong>混淆比特（bit）与字节（byte）</strong>：1 字节 = 8 比特；存储常用字节，信息论与带宽常用比特，换算差 8 倍，是工程沟通的高频坑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话定位：度量信息，是香农信息论的「第一块砖」——先用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 给单条消息定出含多少比特，整座大厦（熵、信道容量、编码定理）才得以在其上建起。下一篇把这把单条消息的尺，推广到「信源平均」与「压缩极限」，那就是熵。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>延伸</strong>：姊妹篇 <a href=\"the-concept-of-entropy\">信息熵的概念</a>｜方法论根源见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/the-power-of-abstraction/separating-information-from-meaning\">思想方法·把信息与意义分离</a>｜比特如何撑起数字世界见 <a href=\"../digital-foundations/foundations-of-digital-age\">数字时代的基础</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>来源</strong>：Shannon, <em>A Mathematical Theory of Communication</em>, BSTJ 27 (1948)（&quot;bit&quot; 一词由 J. W. Tukey 提议见原文致谢）；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Mathematical_Theory_of_Communication\">A Mathematical Theory of Communication 概述</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>香农把信息量挂到概率轴上：信息量 = 消除的不确定性，与「意义」无关。</li>\n<li>比特是一次等概率二选一的信息量，任何选择都能拆成若干次二选一。</li>\n<li>对数是被「独立信息可加」这一要求唯一逼出的度量形式。</li>\n<li>这把尺让文字、声音、图像首次可通约，成为数字融合的前提。</li>\n<li>反模式：把信息量当价值、忘了概率相对于谁、混淆比特与字节。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"度量信息","id":"度量信息"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心直觉：信息是被消除的不确定性","id":"核心直觉-信息是被消除的不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"比特：一个二元选择的信息量","id":"比特-一个二元选择的信息量"},{"level":2,"text":"对数的必然：可加性的要求","id":"对数的必然-可加性的要求"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的威力：让一切媒介通约","id":"度量的威力-让一切媒介通约"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：度量信息时常见的三种误读","id":"反模式-度量信息时常见的三种误读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"《通信的数学理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication"},"next":{"title":"信息熵的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/the-concept-of-entropy"}}